---
// High-Impact Conversion Banner
---

<section class="py-14 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-900 via-indigo-950 to-slate-900 text-white relative overflow-hidden">
  
  <!-- Subtle lighting accents -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 -mr-20 -mt-20 w-80 h-80 bg-blue-500/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 -ml-20 -mb-20 w-80 h-80 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center relative z-10 space-y-6">
    
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 text-xs font-bold border border-amber-500/30 uppercase tracking-widest">
      Limited Management Quota Seats Available
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-snug">
      Don't Compromise on Your Engineering Branch. <br />
      Secure Your CSE or AI/ML Seat Today.
    </h2>

    <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-normal leading-relaxed">
      Connect with a senior admission mentor to compare fee structures, check spot round eligibility, and lock your seat before official registration closes.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 pt-2">
      <a 
        href="https://wa.me/919000000000?text=Hi%20Konfido%2C%20I%20want%20to%20discuss%20engineering%20college%20admissions" 
        target="_blank" 
        rel="noopener"
        class="btn-whatsapp text-sm py-3 px-6 shadow-lg w-full sm:w-auto font-bold"
      >
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="M.057 24l1.687-6.163c-1.041-1.804-1.588-3.849-1.587-5.946.003-6.556 5.338-11.891 11.893-11.891 3.181.001 6.167 1.24 8.413 3.488 2.245 2.248 3.481 5.236 3.48 8.414-.003 6.557-5.338 11.892-11.893 11.892-1.99-.001-3.951-.5-5.688-1.448l-6.305 1.654zm6.597-3.807c1.676.995 3.276 1.591 5.392 1.592 5.448 0 9.886-4.434 9.889-9.885.002-5.462-4.415-9.89-9.881-9.892-5.452 0-9.887 4.434-9.889 9.884-.001 2.225.651 3.891 1.746 5.634l-.999 3.648 3.742-.981z"/>
        </svg>
        Instant WhatsApp Counselling
      </a>

      <a 
        href="tel:+919000000000" 
        class="btn-gold text-sm py-3 px-6 shadow-lg w-full sm:w-auto font-bold"
      >
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z"/>
        </svg>
        Call Admission Helpline
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-4 text-xs text-slate-400">
      Office: Banjara Hills, Hyderabad, Telangana • Available 9:00 AM – 8:00 PM Daily
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
